            "altText": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Table. Every active project ranked by its weighted health score for the selected pillar, with one column per pillar, the share of the score that is measured, the bonus-policy rating and any Safety & Quality cap, the lowest-scoring category and how many more are below target, any data-entry problem and the project status. Filtered to Active projects; clear the Project Status filter in the Filters pane to include inactive ones. Right-click a project to drill through to its health page or a section.'"
